    "display": {
      "name": "RCP \u00b7 Security & access",
      "description": "Refused requests: 401 not signed in, 403 not allowed, 419 expired session / CSRF, 429 throttled. Who is being refused, where from, and is someone probing the login or the debtor links? Generated by docs/observability/signoz/tools/build_dashboards.py; edit the generator, not the JSON."
